Vendored subset of the OnMicro OM6626 SDK
==========================================

This directory contains a build-critical subset of the OnMicro OM6626 SDK
(BSD-3-Clause style license; each source file carries the OnMicro
copyright notice and redistribution conditions).

Upstream:
  - Official:  https://github.com/OnMicro/OM6626_SDK
  - Mirror used locally when vendoring: https://gitee.com/jtcom/OM6626.git
    (commit c34a8ef)

What was kept (enough to build FreeInk firmware + bootloader):
  hal/CMSIS/Core, hal/driver, hal/device (headers + om6626 startup/system),
  hal/device/om6626/rom_lib/current/GCC (linker scripts + rom_lib_ble_1peripheral.a),
  common/, components/ (shell, ble includes+common, nvds, evt, crypto, pm,
  mbr, trace, eeprom, segger), include/, tools/build/, bsp/include/.

What was dropped (not referenced by FreeInk):
  docs/, rtos/, projects/* (except an auto-created `projects/freeink`
  symlink), IAR/ARM toolchain libs, rom_lib variants except the 1-peripheral
  BLE library, CMSIS DSP.

Full SDK (much larger, includes examples & docs) is available from the
upstream URLs above; set SDK_ROOT to an external copy if you prefer:
  make BOARD=ZKC21V SDK_ROOT=/path/to/OM6626-sdk
